{'symbol': 'APA', 'date': '2022-06-14 11:50:00', 'title': '2022-2023 APPLICATIONS FOR APACHE CORPORATION TREE GRANT PROGRAM NOW OPEN', 'text': "HOUSTON, JUNE 14, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- APACHE CORPORATION, A SUBSIDIARY OF APA CORPORATION (NASDAQ: APA), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE OPENING OF THE APACHE CORPORATION TREE GRANT PROGRAM APPLICATION FOR THE 2022-2023 PLANTING SEASON. SINCE THE PROGRAM'S LAUNCH IN 2005, THE COMPANY HAS DONATED MORE THAN 4.8 MILLION TREES TO OVER 900 NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS AND GOVERNMENT AGENCIES."}